
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Contact EasyForm Tools for questions, feedback, or help with our free photo and PDF tools.">
  <title>Contact Us | EasyForm Tools</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #18212f;
      background: #f5f7fb;
    }
    main {
      background: white;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 14px;
    }
    h1, h2 { color: #3659d9; }
    a { color: #3659d9; }
    .email {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: #edf2ff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>

    <p>Thank you for visiting EasyForm Tools! We welcome your questions, feedback, and suggestions.</p>

    <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
    <p>If you need help using our photo resizing, photo compression, or image-to-PDF tools, you can contact us by email.</p>

    <p class="email">
      <a href="mailto:easyformtools.contact@gmail.com">
        easyformtools.contact@gmail.com
      </a>
    </p>

    <p>We will do our best to review your message and respond when possible. Please do not email passwords or sensitive personal documents.</p>

    <h2>Feedback and Suggestions</h2>
    <p>Your feedback helps us improve EasyForm Tools and make our free tools more useful.</p>

    <p><a href="/">Return to EasyForm Tools</a></p>
    <p><a href="/privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
